<BaseLayout title="Biography" description="Biography of the artist Thomas Rubick.">
  <h1 class="page-title">Biography</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Thomas Michael Rubick was a painter and illustrator/designer with over thirty
      years of professional experience. He earned a BA from California State
      University at Long Beach and an MA from Kent State University.
    </p>
    <p>
      He co-founded Rubick &amp; Funk Graphic Design in Eugene, Oregon, and served as
      Coordinator of the Graphic Design Program at Lane Community College from 1988 to
      2007. He taught for five years as an adjunct instructor at the University of
      Oregon and instructed in the Art Department at Lane Community College for
      twenty-one years.
    </p>
    <p>
      Tom passed away in July 2009. With characteristic wit and tenderness, he wrote
      his own obituary.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/obituary-tom-rubick.pdf">Read Tom's obituary (PDF)</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
